DATA NOTICE

AlgaeWatch aggregates data published by U.S. federal agencies:
NOAA (CoastWatch ERDDAP, National Weather Service), USGS, and the EPA/USGS
Water Quality Portal. Those data are works of the U.S. Government and are not
subject to copyright protection in the United States. Each dataset retains its
own citation and public-domain terms; see DATA_SOURCES.md for the exact
endpoints and provenance of every value displayed.

This software is provided for informational purposes only and is not a
regulatory or public-health determination. Data may be incomplete, delayed, or
revised by the publishing agency. Absence of data does not indicate absence of
harmful algal blooms.
